+		/* FOX: instant flashlight toggle on "Volume-Up + Power".
+		   The stock implementation only fires after a 200ms hold, which makes a
+		   quick tap do nothing. Detect the combo as soon as the second key of
+		   the pair goes down (within 400ms of the first), so one tap turns the
