+			// Legacy path: leave a bare "boot-recovery" BCB in /misc and do a
+			// *plain* reboot. The bootloader then walks its full boot path
+			// (splash -> kernel -> recovery) instead of jumping straight to the
+			// recovery partition through the restart reason, which only makes
+			// the logo flash for a moment.
+			std::string bcb_err;
